===============================================================================
Mini-SGLang
===============================================================================

Substantial portions of the runtime began from Mini-SGLang and have since been
restructured and extended by cti. Mini-SGLang describes itself as a compact
implementation of SGLang, and cti also cites public SGLang architecture as a
design reference:
https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang

No production source from the full SGLang repository is separately incorporated
outside this Mini-SGLang lineage. The installed sglang-kernel package remains an
external dependency and carries its own distribution terms.

Upstream project:
https://github.com/sgl-project/mini-sglang

