===============================================================================
DFlash
===============================================================================

`python/cti/models/dflash/model.py` implements the DFlash v1 draft model on
cti's lower layers. Its context projection, block-versus-context attention and
checkpoint names are adapted from the official DFlash implementation; its decoder
composition retains the Mini-SGLang-derived layer lineage documented above. The round
semantics of `python/cti/inference/_execution/_speculative/dflash.py` follow the
same reference; that file is written for cti's runtime. Production code imports
no official DFlash module.

Upstream project:
https://github.com/z-lab/dflash

